.Dd November 20, 2026
.Dt POWEROFF 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm poweroff
.Nd stop services and power off the system
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility stops the running services through
.Xr svcd 8 ,
flushes file systems, and requests the kernel poweroff action.
It requires effective uid 0.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
A permission or kernel failure exits 1.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr reboot 1 ,
.Xr shutdown 1 ,
.Xr svcd 8
